WEBVTT

00:01.100 --> 00:04.110
Remember when kids' software came in a box?

00:06.000 --> 00:07.480
You brought it home.

00:07.500 --> 00:09.243
You put in the disc.

00:10.350 --> 00:12.319
A rabbit taught you to read.

00:12.650 --> 00:14.582
A spaceship taught you math.

00:16.000 --> 00:17.370
It was fun.

00:17.500 --> 00:18.959
It was yours.

00:19.300 --> 00:21.278
And nobody was watching.

00:23.300 --> 00:25.224
Then something changed.

00:26.000 --> 00:28.280
Everything became a subscription.

00:28.300 --> 00:29.480
Free trials.

00:29.500 --> 00:30.680
Monthly fees.

00:30.700 --> 00:31.480
Ads.

00:31.500 --> 00:32.380
Streaks.

00:32.400 --> 00:34.571
Anything to keep them tapping.

00:35.400 --> 00:39.337
And somewhere along the way, our kids stopped being the customer,

00:40.150 --> 00:42.042
and became the product.

00:44.000 --> 00:46.190
We think kids deserve better.

00:47.100 --> 00:50.244
So we're making software the way it used to be.

00:51.050 --> 00:53.266
PNW Kid Software.

00:54.700 --> 00:55.876
Math.

00:56.033 --> 00:57.219
Reading.

00:57.367 --> 00:58.614
Writing.

00:58.700 --> 00:59.902
Typing.

01:00.033 --> 01:01.183
Coding.

01:01.367 --> 01:02.668
Language.

01:02.700 --> 01:03.992
Feelings.

01:04.033 --> 01:05.267
Making.

01:05.287 --> 01:06.595
And bugs.

01:09.667 --> 01:11.197
Fully private.

01:11.217 --> 01:12.530
No ads.

01:12.550 --> 01:13.863
No accounts.

01:13.883 --> 01:15.197
No tracking.

01:15.217 --> 01:17.230
We collect nothing at all.

01:17.467 --> 01:18.947
Always free to try.

01:18.967 --> 01:20.500
Then $4.99.

01:20.520 --> 01:21.680
Once.

01:21.883 --> 01:23.197
No subscription.

01:23.217 --> 01:24.296
Ever.

01:25.717 --> 01:27.419
Tested by kids.

01:27.883 --> 01:29.824
Shaped with educators.

01:31.750 --> 01:34.013
Software that's fun again.
